# ============================================================
# ALL INDIA DOCTORS CLUB ASSOCIATION - ENVIRONMENT CONFIG
# ============================================================

# By default, all registrations are saved permanently to `data/registrations.json`
# If you run on a VPS, local machine, PM2, or Docker, no extra config is needed!

# FOR VERCEL / SERVERLESS DEPLOYMENTS (Zero Data Loss across redeploys):
# Vercel serverless functions have ephemeral local files.
# To keep data permanently across unlimited redeployments on Vercel:
# 1. Connect free Upstash Redis or Vercel KV (Free 10,000 requests/day):
# 2. Add these two environment variables in your Vercel project settings:

# KV_REST_API_URL=https://your-upstash-redis-url.upstash.io
# KV_REST_API_TOKEN=your-upstash-token-here

# ADMIN PASSCODE
# Default admin PIN is 1234
# ADMIN_PIN=1234
